{"id": 78156, "field": "description", "ja": "体力$N1のTremor Totemを足元に召喚します。トーテムは周囲の地面を揺らし、$N2ヤード以内のパーティーメンバーからFear、Charm、Sleepの効果を取り除きます。", "status": "unaligned", "checks": [], "provenance": {"class": "machine", "model": "claude-opus-5-5", "source": "draft-served-sd2-sg12@2026-10-02", "imported": "2026-10-02"}, "english": {"hash": "c1259d2b4d2aaedb", "src": "db2@1.60.1.70170"}, "reasons": [], "conflicts": []}
{"id": 78159, "field": "description", "ja": "体力$N1のWindfury Totemを術者の足元に召喚します。トーテムは$N3ヤード以内のパーティーとレイドのメンバー全員に近接攻撃の加速$N2%を与えます。効果時間は$D1です。", "status": "unaligned", "checks": [], "provenance": {"class": "machine", "model": "claude-opus-5-5", "source": "draft-served-sd2-sg12@2026-10-02", "imported": "2026-10-02"}, "english": {"hash": "4a946e59ad178732", "src": "db2@1.60.1.70170"}, "reasons": [], "conflicts": []}
